			<Item class="Script" referent="RBX62CC10CE2E0F4CAD9045B0E2E88E9598">
				<Properties>
					<ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[--[[
	
thienbao2109's Edit Version(Yup, I edited it with lots of features)[From top to bottom, means from old to latest]
==================================================
-Smooth zooming(Using TweenService)
-Added "Ironsight" setting
-Added "BulletShellEjection" setting
-Added "HitCharacterSound" setting
-Added zooming sound for sniper
-Replaced "BrickColor" to "Color3" for bullet visualizer
-Updated scope gui
-Added "MuzzleLight" setting
-Added "Hitmarker" setting
-"Ironsight" and "Sniper" are require first-person to zoom, not third-person
-Added "BulletWhizzingSound" setting
-Fixed "IgniteScript"
-Change "q" key into "LMB" key. So you can aim the gun easily(Special thanks to Zhekoay)
-Added "Tween" setting
-Updated "CameraShaking" setting
-Added "BloodVisualizer" setting, finally...
-Fixed some issues
-Added "ImpactVisualizer" setting
-Added "BulletHole" setting
-Updated blood and hit effect-visualizer
-Updated "BulletVisualizer" setting
-Fixed "DualEnabled" setting
-Gun kit is now works with R15(Except animations)
-Added "HoldDown" setting
-Added equip sound
-Updated "LimitClip" setting
-Fixed "HoldDown" setting
-Added "WalkSpeedRedution" setting
-Updated mouse sensitive script
-Adjusted visualizer scripts
-Fixed and updated "BulletShellEjection" setting
-Added "EquippedAnimation" setting
-Added "BulletRange" setting
-Changed Ammo->Mag, Clips->Ammo
-Fixed Hitmarker sound(Simply put the sound into PlayerGui)
-Re-updated mouse sensitive(script)
-Added "RecoilRedution" setting
-Fixed muzzle flash that did not visible
-Mobile supports
-Added "CustomHitEffect" setting for "ImpactVisualizer" setting
-Added "AngleZ" for "CameraRecoiling" setting
-New crosshair
-New recoil
-New bullet physic(Using Xan_TheDragon's FastCast module)
-Added "FleshHole" setting
-Updated "BulletHole" setting
-Temporary removed "Knockback" and "Piercing" setting
-Updated "BulletVisualizer" setting again
-Updated "Explosive" setting
-Re-added "Knockback" setting
-Updated "Hitmarker" setting
-Fixed bullet particle that still emit after hit
-Updated "BulletWhizzingSound" setting
-Smooth bullet, and increased fire/muzzle sensitivity
-Added "BulletMesh" setting for bullet visualizer
-Better mobile control
-Added "BulletLight" setting for bullet visualizer
-Updated scope gui
-Added "EquippingTime" setting
==================================================
	
v1.0.7
==================================================
-Fixed a bug which gun shooting automatically even "Auto" setting is disabled
==================================================
	
v1.0.6
==================================================
-Fixed a glitch which player can shooting even after died
-Added "ChargedShot" setting
-Added "Minigun" setting
-Added "Piercing" setting
-Added "FadeTime" setting
-Updated "BulletVisualizerScript". Replace an older one now!
==================================================
	
v1.0.5
==================================================
-Fixed a gun that shoot slower even you set "FireRate" to lower
-Added "ShotgunReload" setting
==================================================
	
v1.0.4
==================================================
-Fixed VisualizeBulletScript and BulletVisualizerScript. Previously, it's a bug that doesn't show bullet for other player.
-Fixed a bug which scope still in use even unequipped
==================================================
	
v1.0.3
==================================================
-Fixed a bug that you can reload a gun even unequip
-Ray start position is now at Player's Head instead Gun Muzzle
-Added "DualEnabled" setting
-Added Ammo Box for the gun
-User can no longer use Scope while reloading
==================================================
	
v1.0.2
==================================================
-Fixed Bullet Visualizer that doesn't display fake bullet to other player
-Fixed fake bullet still displayed even "VisualizerEnabled" is disabled
==================================================
	
v1.0.1
==================================================
-Fixed reload
-Ammo GUI will not show if AmmoPerClip is "math.huge"
-Added Animation setting
==================================================
	
v1.0
==================================================
-First release
==================================================
	
--]]]]></ProtectedString>
